  "title": "Register native C/C++ git engine component with read-only shadow scope and maturity ladder",
  "summary": "Registers git-engine-native (C++23 execution, C stable ABI) as a new implementation of the existing git-automation capability; M0 scope is read-only parity probing only, the C# host remains the sole committer; declares the M0-M4 maturity ladder whose final state is a mature C/C++ engine.",
  "requested_by": "permission-sovereign",
  "origin": "user explicit 2026-10-03 instruction: upgrade the engine first, final goal a mature C/C++ engine",
  "problem": {
    "summary": "The git plane runs only on the C# host with no native successor path; without a registered native component and maturity ladder, any C/C++ git work is unowned and risks parallel authority or duplicated orchestration.",
    "current": "GPTBridge.GitAutomation (C#) is the sole committer; native/ has no git module.",
    "impact": "No governed path exists to mature the git engine toward C/C++ ownership."
  },
  "change_class": "architecture-authority",
  "required_review": "five-sovereign-audit-unanimous-pass",
